    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "他の部屋と同じ鍵と、パスワード入力式の鍵……\r\nふたつ使われてるんだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080020"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "本当のマスターキーを持っているのは『Ａ』ですが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "パスワード入力式の鍵を\r\n彼はこの部屋に増設したみたいですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1021",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "それでは、開けます──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00690",
    "fg": "002341",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 2000,
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffectTime": 1500,
    "bgm": "065",
    "se": "0457",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（伝えられた暗証番号で隠し部屋の鍵を開ければ、\r\n生臭い匂いが鼻腔を突き刺す）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（きちんとあるべき場所に収まっていたであろう\r\nゴルフクラブやトロフィーなどが散乱し、酷い有り様だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（天井近くまでディスプレイされている\r\n様々なレコードやＣＤには、手がつけられた様子はない）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（その中で、俺の師である『Ａ』は、\r\n部屋の中央に仰向けになって横たわっている──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "fg": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "状況的に、物盗りのようにも見えるけれど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "わざわざ探偵が集まってる状況で人殺しをする目的が、\r\n物盗りっていうのもねぇ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なんでそんな難しいことするの？　って感じでしょ\r\n予告出してから盗む『怪盗２８３』じゃあるまいし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……あ\r\nスマートウォッチ、壊されてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "これじゃーデータ、取れないかぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "私も残念です……\r\nでは、死亡推定時刻を割り出すキットを使いますね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080080,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、助かります",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080080"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080090,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "それではあらためて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080100,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……ご遺体を拝見させてもらいます、\r\nよろしいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "ああ……\r\nお願いします",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "それじゃー私も\r\n気になるところ、調べようかなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "──お弟子さん、犯人っぽい人がいないか\r\n見張っててくださいねー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080120"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "誰が犯人か、\r\nまだ絞れてもいないんでー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "心苦しいですが……\r\nそうですね、わかりました……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……遠慮はいらないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080140"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032080150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "こちらも、アナタを見守らせてもらっているのだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103208/4901032080150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1112",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "fg": "002341"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（幽谷霧子と白瀬咲耶は『Ａ』の遺体を……\r\n三峰結華と田中摩美々は部屋の様子を……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（月岡恋鐘は\r\nクローゼットや引き出しの中を見ているようだ……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "（さて、俺はどうするか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]